{"_id": "684065b04c7ad11f50c7a87d", "id": "joyce8/EMBER2024", "author": "joyce8", "sha": "3d23efef7c0f0b702c5024400cfff4c3744a3832", "lastModified": "2025-08-22T20:14:18.000Z", "private": false, "gated": false, "disabled": false, "tags": ["license:apache-2.0", "arxiv:2506.05074", "region:us"], "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tEMBER2024 Dataset\n\t\n\nEMBER2024 is an update to the EMBER2017 and EMBER2018 datasets. It includes raw features and labels for 3.2 million malicious and benign files from 6 different file types (Win32, Win64, .NET, APK, ELF, and PDF). EMBER2024 is meant to allow researchers to explore a variety of common malware analysis classification tasks. The dataset includes 7 types of labels and tags that support malicious/benign detection, malware family classification, malware behavior\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/joyce8/EMBER2024.", "downloads": 4074, "likes": 16, "cardData": {"license": "apache-2.0"}, "siblings": [{"rfilename": ".gitattributes", "blobId": "1ef325f1b111266a6b26e0196871bd78baa8c2f3", "size": 2461}, {"rfilename": "APK_test.zip", "blobId": "337dbea8929e102f557c8559564cdf39d1f3b5c2", "size": 177491965, "lfs": {"sha256": "caadda48f332dd2dae425c7e33d04aa66f28286431c9e4cfed23409fe06385cc", "size": 177491965, "pointerSize": 134}}, {"rfilename": "APK_train.zip", "blobId": "62079fd4816c12defbadf2ea16dca2d715471a0f", "size": 783638534, "lfs": {"sha256": "aa9e0b026efd65d916fa3e9f81aaadcf5519e721311d2e7959226721a56d0041", "size": 783638534, "pointerSize": 134}}, {"rfilename": "Dot_Net_test.zip", "blobId": "6fd14c5cac19596724d7b96c038d0560efc6beab", "size": 220481493, "lfs": {"sha256": "b74c4181dbd77565fce16ba47c8ab0f7c7044ae6d880d859ec2c27365dea6299", "size": 220481493, "pointerSize": 134}}, {"rfilename": "Dot_Net_train.zip", "blobId": "e603a7a197814bbd6c5c53e068ec1824bc2e6734", "size": 937108923, "lfs": {"sha256": "b9f6e90ab75293a7ceb9339700586dd033a03d19766282755ee31dfa0836e625", "si